ZIP Code Search API - Arquitetura

Client: Cliente (HTTP) {
  shape: cloud
}

Controller: ZipCodeController {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#2563eb"
  style.fill: "#eff6ff"
  style.border-radius: 8
}

UseCase: FindZipCodeUseCaseImpl {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
  style.fill: "#f5f3ff"
  style.border-radius: 8
}

Cache: ZipCodeCacheAdapter {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  style.fill: "#fef2f2"
  style.border-radius: 8
}

DB: ZipCodePersistenceAdapter {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#059669"
  style.fill: "#ecfdf5"
  style.border-radius: 8
}

External: CnpjaZipAdapter {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#d97706"
  style.fill: "#fffbeb"
  style.border-radius: 8
}

Redis: Redis {
  shape: cylinder
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  style.fill: "#fef2f2"
}

Postgres: PostgreSQL {
  shape: cylinder
  style.stroke: "#059669"
  style.fill: "#ecfdf5"
}

CNPJa: API CNPJa {
  shape: cloud
  style.stroke: "#d97706"
  style.fill: "#fffbeb"
}

Validador: Valida formato {
  shape: diamond
  style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
  style.fill: "#f5f3ff"
}

Erro400: 400 CEP invalido {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  style.fill: "#fef2f2"
}

Erro404: 404 CEP nao encontrado {
  shape: rectangle
  style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  style.fill: "#fef2f2"
}

Client -> Controller: GET /api/v1/zip/CEP
Controller -> Validador

Validador -> Erro400: Invalido
Validador -> UseCase: Valido (normaliza)

UseCase -> Cache: 1. Verifica Redis
Cache -> Redis
Redis -> Cache: existe?
Cache -> UseCase: sim + TTL

UseCase -> DB: 2. Se nao no cache
DB -> Postgres
Postgres -> DB: existe?
DB -> UseCase: sim + salva cache

UseCase -> External: 3. Se nao no banco
External -> CNPJa
CNPJa -> External: existe?
External -> UseCase: sim + persiste

UseCase -> Erro404: Nao encontrado
UseCase -> Controller: ZipCodeResponse
Controller -> Client: JSON 200
